<div class="page-title clearfix"><h1>Email Marketing Audit &amp; Recovery</h1><div class="title-button-group"><a class="btn btn-default" href="<?php echo site_url('email_marketing'); ?>">Campaigns</a> <a class="btn btn-default" href="<?php echo site_url('email_marketing/test-delivery'); ?>">Test Delivery</a></div></div>
<div class="alert alert-warning"><strong>Non-destructive report.</strong> No campaign status, lead record, queue row, or delivery row was changed by this page. Test mode must remain enabled.</div>

<div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Queue and cron diagnostics</h3><p>Queue processor: CRM cron hook <code>/index.php/cron</code>. No Windows scheduled task was found by the audit. Last recorded CRM cron timestamp: <strong><?php echo esc($last_cron->setting_value ?? 'not recorded'); ?></strong>.</p><p>Module enabled: <strong><?php echo (($safe_settings['enabled'] ?? '') === '1') ? 'yes' : 'no'; ?></strong> &nbsp; Test mode: <strong><?php echo (($safe_settings['test_mode'] ?? '') === '1') ? 'enabled' : 'NOT ENABLED'; ?></strong> &nbsp; Approved test addresses: <strong><?php echo $safe_settings['approved_test_emails'] !== '' ? 'configured (value hidden)' : 'none'; ?></strong></p><p>SMTP configuration fields present: <strong><?php echo count(array_filter($smtp)) . '/' . count($smtp); ?></strong>. This confirms configuration presence only; it does not perform SMTP authentication or send mail.</p></div></div>

<div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Campaigns stuck in Sending</h3><?php foreach ($campaigns as $c): ?><div class="card mb15"><div class="card-body"><h4>#<?php echo (int) $c->id; ?> — <?php echo esc($c->name); ?></h4><p>Created: <?php echo esc($c->created_at); ?> | Saved eligible count: <?php echo (int) $c->last_eligible_count; ?> | Actual eligible now: <?php echo $c->actual_eligible_count === null ? 'unavailable' : (int) $c->actual_eligible_count; ?></p><p>Recipients: <?php echo (int) $c->recipient_count; ?> total; <?php echo (int) $c->queued_count; ?> queued; <?php echo (int) $c->sent_count; ?> sent; <?php echo (int) $c->failed_count; ?> failed; <?php echo (int) $c->skipped_count; ?> skipped; <?php echo (int) $c->unsubscribed_count; ?> unsubscribed.</p><p>Delivery-log entries: <?php echo (int) $c->test_log_count; ?> | Queue entries: <?php echo (int) $c->recipient_count; ?> | Last queued: <?php echo esc($c->last_queued ?: 'none'); ?> | Last attempted: <?php echo esc($c->last_attempt ?: 'none'); ?></p><p><strong>Finding:</strong> <?php echo ((int) $c->queued_count > 0) ? 'Queued rows remain unprocessed; cron/queue processing is the current blocker.' : 'No queued rows remain; status requires manual reconciliation.'; ?> <?php if ($c->id == 3): ?>The saved filter is empty, so this campaign has zero actual eligible recipients.<?php endif; ?></p><p><strong>Safe recommendation:</strong> <?php echo ($c->actual_eligible_count === 0) ? 'Return to Draft after review; do not mark Completed.' : 'Pause while cron and test-recipient approval are repaired; do not mark Completed.'; ?></p><div class="mt10"><a class="btn btn-default" href="<?php echo site_url('email_marketing/logs/' . $c->id); ?>">View queue/log</a> <form method="post" action="<?php echo site_url('email_marketing/recovery/' . $c->id . '/pause'); ?>" style="display:inline" onsubmit="return confirm('Pause this campaign and write an audit entry?');"><input type="hidden" name="<?php echo csrf_token(); ?>" value="<?php echo csrf_hash(); ?>"><button class="btn btn-warning">Pause</button></form> <form method="post" action="<?php echo site_url('email_marketing/recovery/' . $c->id . '/draft'); ?>" style="display:inline" onsubmit="return confirm('Return this campaign to Draft and write an audit entry?');"><input type="hidden" name="<?php echo csrf_token(); ?>" value="<?php echo csrf_hash(); ?>"><button class="btn btn-default">Return to Draft</button></form> <form method="post" action="<?php echo site_url('email_marketing/recovery/' . $c->id . '/failed'); ?>" style="display:inline" onsubmit="return confirm('Mark this campaign Failed and write an audit entry?');"><input type="hidden" name="<?php echo csrf_token(); ?>" value="<?php echo csrf_hash(); ?>"><button class="btn btn-danger">Mark Failed</button></form></div></div></div><?php endforeach; if (!$campaigns): ?><p>No campaigns currently have Sending status.</p><?php endif; ?></div></div>

<div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Deleted-lead audit</h3><p><strong><?php echo (int) $deletion_summary['total']; ?></strong> deleted leads; <strong><?php echo (int) $deletion_summary['with_email']; ?></strong> still have an email address. Consent rows: <?php echo (int) $deletion_summary['consent_rows']; ?>; campaign-recipient rows: <?php echo (int) $deletion_summary['campaign_rows']; ?>; suppression rows: <?php echo (int) $deletion_summary['suppression_rows']; ?>.</p><p>Deletion month, deleted-by, and deletion reason are unavailable in the current schema/audit trail. The month filter below is therefore based on <strong>lead creation date</strong>, not deletion date.</p><h4>By owner</h4><table class="table"><tr><th>Owner</th><th>Deleted leads</th></tr><?php foreach ($owners as $row): ?><tr><td><?php echo esc($row->name ?: 'Unassigned'); ?></td><td><?php echo (int) $row->total; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table><h4>By lead status</h4><table class="table"><tr><th>Status</th><th>Deleted leads</th></tr><?php foreach ($statuses as $row): ?><tr><td><?php echo esc($row->name); ?></td><td><?php echo (int) $row->total; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table></div></div>

<div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h3>Restoration Preview — no restore action</h3><form method="get" action="<?php echo site_url('email_marketing/audit'); ?>" class="row"><div class="col-md-2"><label>State</label><input class="form-control" name="state" value="<?php echo esc($filters['state']); ?>"></div><div class="col-md-2"><label>Owner ID</label><input class="form-control" type="number" name="owner_id" value="<?php echo esc($filters['owner_id'] ?: ''); ?>"></div><div class="col-md-2"><label>Status ID</label><input class="form-control" type="number" name="status_id" value="<?php echo esc($filters['status_id'] ?: ''); ?>"></div><div class="col-md-2"><label>Created from</label><input class="form-control" type="date" name="created_from" value="<?php echo esc($filters['created_from']); ?>"></div><div class="col-md-2"><label>Created to</label><input class="form-control" type="date" name="created_to" value="<?php echo esc($filters['created_to']); ?>"></div><div class="col-md-2"><label>Email</label><select class="form-control" name="email"><option value="">Any</option><option value="yes" <?php echo $filters['email'] === 'yes' ? 'selected' : ''; ?>>Present</option><option value="no" <?php echo $filters['email'] === 'no' ? 'selected' : ''; ?>>Missing</option></select></div><div class="col-md-2 mt10"><label>Consent</label><select class="form-control" name="consent"><option value="">Any</option><?php foreach (['Unknown','Opted In','Opted Out'] as $value): ?><option value="<?php echo esc($value); ?>" <?php echo $filters['consent'] === $value ? 'selected' : ''; ?>><?php echo esc($value); ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><div class="col-md-2 mt10"><button class="btn btn-primary">Preview</button></div></form><p class="mt15">Showing up to 200 candidates. No restore button is present.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><tr><th>Name</th><th>Email</th><th>Phone</th><th>Owner</th><th>Status</th><th>State</th><th>Created date</th><th>Consent</th></tr><?php foreach ($candidates as $lead): ?><tr><td><?php echo esc($lead->lead_name); ?></td><td><?php echo esc($lead->email); ?></td><td><?php echo esc($lead->phone); ?></td><td><?php echo esc($lead->owner_name); ?></td><td><?php echo esc($lead->lead_status); ?></td><td><?php echo esc($lead->state); ?></td><td><?php echo esc($lead->created_date); ?></td><td><?php echo esc($lead->consent); ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; if (!$candidates): ?><tr><td colspan="8">No candidates match these filters.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></table></div></div></div>
